tei:div.tei:p:
) bar/ ( 'ur sum brdung cha ya sum brdung*/ ) dkon mchog gsum gyi= sogs nas smon lam/ 'phrad par shog bar/ bzang spyod sogs bsngo smon 'don/ hūm̐ hrīḥphyogs bcu'i= sogs kyis grub/ gter gzhung rang gi dgongs pa ltar na/ hūm̐/ dang po gri byung= sogs/ 'gro ba bdun la gtor ma re sbyar/ gzhan nar 'gros byas pas bka' brgyad 'di'i rang lugs thun min o rgyan sangs rgyas gnyis pa'i dgongs bzhed dang thun na mthar thug sa yin pas gtso bor bzung dgos/ bden dril bzlog bong khyung dregs gsum/ zor byin rlabs bskor rnams dang*/ sgo dbye/ dngos grub/ bskul pa phyi sgo/ chad tho/ zor/ bstan ma/ mnan pa bcas sngar ltar/ mchod bstod/ tshe 'gugs man chad sngar ltar bya'o/ 'gugs pa'i kha bsgyur ni/ bden chung la  gnod byed gri sri gri btsan dang*/ 517) /gson bdud gshin lcags gang yin rnams/ rtsa rgyud la/ gson gyi bdud dang gshin gyi lcags byed pa'i//
gri sri gri btsan sdang dgra gdon bgegs sogs//
yid la brnag pa'i gri sri 'di rnams kyi/ 'gugs pa'i tshe de ltar bya dgos/ ༈ gri 'dul sreg pa'i dkyil 'khor bri thabs dang nyer spyad dgos rigs la/ dang po khro dkyil rta babs bzhi pa la/ nang gling bzhi la/ 'og tu ra sog trisaḥmatshan pa re re/ hom khung gru gsum re re/ mda' dar lha rang mdog dang mthun pa re re 'ju+ug mthar gtsang ris bskor/ bsreg ling grangs mang*/ mtshams bzhir mda' bzhi/ srad bu me 'geb ljang khu/ g.yon gyi mchod gzhi'i steng sman rag gtor ma nag po bcu/ drag po rnams la zhal zas nag po bcu/ g.yas su bsreg gzhi'i steng*/ rdzas spungs sder bcu drug yam shing*/ mar khu/ ku sha dgang blug mañdzi/ lcags sder gang 'dzoms thab kyi  518) nam mkhar liṅga rgyang*/ shog ling bcu/ mdun du zur bzhi bsnol ma/ brub khung zan ling can bcu/ phur pa bcu/ khrag snod/ sbreng thur/ gri rdo/ gri lcags tho ba/
